think about his legacy you think  about him and what he meant to this  franchise for 20 plus years  and what he stood for both on the floor  and off the floor  what he demanded out of his teammates  what he demanded out of himself  the win comes after kobe and his 13 year  old daughter gianna  died in a helicopter crash along with  seven others in calabasas california in  january  following the series winning game lebron  reflected on how  kobe's death affected the team and  propelled them  through the season we got  as close as you possibly can be when  that moment happened  um and obviously we know it brought the  whole basketball world close  as well but when you're internal um and  it hits home  it just means that much more and we  locked in from that very moment  and saying this is um this is bigger  than us
 

